sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as App (Alex)
    participant API as api: HTTP span
    participant DB as PostgreSQL:<br/>event_log
    participant GW as api: fan-out span
    participant AD as Adapter:<br/>invoke_agent span
    participant RT as Runtime<br/>(TRACEPARENT)
    App->>API: POST message, traceparent<br/>(trace ID T, the server decides sampling)
    API->>DB: Commit, correlation_id = T,<br/>trace_context stored
    DB-->>GW: NOTIFY
    GW->>GW: Span event.fanout with link to T
    GW-->>AD: dispatch agent.invocation<br/>with trace_context
    AD->>AD: Span invoke_agent,<br/>parent context from trace_context
    AD->>RT: Start run,<br/>TRACEPARENT in the environment
    RT-->>AD: Tools, text<br/>(own spans under T)
    AD->>API: POST /runs/{id}/start and PATCH,<br/>traceparent under T
    AD->>API: POST message (origin agent),<br/>traceparent under T
    API-->>App: dispatch message.created<br/>(span event.fanout with link to T)
